      AI logic after switching to next player","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"12005813-c2d0-4bc1-a4d2-dcf89a5acee2","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":6769.0,"yMin":-2212.0,"xMax":7149.0,"yMax":-2009.0},"label":"Remove
