      if there are still unplayed color, but not all of them","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"e13f2311-7cac-4013-aa21-fd8654075586","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1318.0,"yMin":156.0,"xMax":1904.0,"yMax":411.0},"label":"Check
      if cards have already been played","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"65f296ef-a5e0-437a-bed9-3ffb30969305","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":2162.0,"yMin":-169.0,"xMax":2513.0,"yMax":475.0},"label":"Set
      isFirstPlayer bool","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"9b10c200-f39c-4bd1-b292-bc368ac3609d","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":1294.0,"yMin":-235.0,"xMax":2856.0,"yMax":499.0},"label":"Check
      if First Player","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"44b49bb1-6e02-4aa4-abb8-4fc83d1151b7","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":3139.0,"yMin":-1103.0,"xMax":3543.0,"yMax":-538.0},"label":"Set
      hasAce bool","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"e661d96c-3760-4533-89a3-5126213b1aad","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":7075.0,"yMin":-1434.0,"xMax":8499.0,"yMax":-983.0},"label":"Check
      if ScriptableObjects stored in possibleCards match GameObjects from aiHand","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"d1c5b4e5-c391-4acd-8845-116334b1cf88","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":13481.0,"yMin":-2961.0,"xMax":14905.0,"yMax":-2338.0},"label":"Check
      if ScriptableObjects stored in possibleCards match GameObjects from aiHand","comment":null,"color":{"r":0.0,"g":0.0,"b":0.0,"a":1.0},"guid":"77262858-deb4-4ea4-9679-e532aebc4c68","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":7128.0,"yMin":-1195.0,"xMax":7462.0,"yMax":-1008.0},"title":"Second
      For Each Loop","body":"\nI cannot use ScriptableOjects (from possibleCards)
      directly to make the AI plays its card \n-> it''s NOT GAMEOBJECTS\n\nInstead,
      the second For Each Loop is used to check if some cards displayed in the AI''s
      hand match the Card Data stored in the possibleCards list \n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"81833bac-ef53-4d21-ae9b-1e49b9dd2f68","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-3588.0,"yMin":868.0,"xMax":-2813.0,"yMax":1169.0},"title":"TO
      DO !","body":"\nPLAYER SPECIFIC :\n\n- SET CARDS BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n-
      SET CARDS COUNT BY COLOR AFTER DEALING CARDS\n\nSHARED INBETWEEN PLAYERS :\n\n-
      When a card is played this round, ADD IT TO PLAYEDCARDSTHISROUND\n- When a
      card is played, ADD IT TO ALLPLAYEDCARDS\n- When a card is played, ADD IT TO
      CURRENTTRICKPLAYERCARDS with reference to the PLAYER\n- When a player is out
      of cards from a specific color, ADD A REFERENCE TO THIS COLOR TO PLAYERSWHOHAVECUT\n-
      When a card is played, REMOVE ITS COLOR FROM UNPLAYEDCOLOR\n- When a card is
      played, DECREMENT ITS COLOR''S VALUE FROM STRONGESTREMAININGCARDBYCOLOR\n\n\n\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"807bba9d-73c0-4f2d-a558-d37316c1ad90","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":-702.0,"yMin":-2075.0,"xMax":-348.0,"yMax":-1956.0},"title":"List
      contains Item","body":"\nThe node cannot be used in this situation because
      :\n\n- It checks for EXACT GAMEOBJECT references\n- It does NOT check for properties
